(23, 13, 13, 'MÓDULO 9 – Nage Waza (Projeções) - Ashi Waza (Técnicas de perna ou pé)', '<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Ashi Waza - T&eacute;cnicas de perna ou p&eacute;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>O-Soto-Gari: </strong>Grande ceifada externa</p>\r\n<p><iframe style=\"display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/c-A_nP7mKAc\" width=\"300\" height=\"168\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\r\n<p><strong>O Uchi Gari: </strong>Grande ceifada interna</p>\r\n<p><iframe style=\"display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/65u6c7FQOMU\" width=\"300\" height=\"168\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe><strong>Ko Soto Gari:&nbsp;</strong>Pequena ceifada externa</p>\r\n<p><iframe style=\"display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jeQ541ScLB4\" width=\"300\" height=\"168\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe><strong>Ko Soto Gake:&nbsp;</strong>Pequeno gancho externo</p>\r\n<p><iframe style=\"display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8b6kY4s4zH4\" width=\"300\" height=\"168\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe><strong>O-Soto-Guruma: </strong>Grande roda externa</p>\r\n<p><iframe style=\"display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/92KbCm6pQeI\" width=\"300\" height=\"168\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\r\n<p><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0,0\"><strong>De Ashi Harai:&nbsp;</strong></span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1,0\">Varredura no p&eacute; que avan&ccedil;a</span></p>\r\n<p><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,1,0\"><iframe style=\"display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4BUUvqxi_Kk\" width=\"300\" height=\"168\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></p>\r\n<p><sp